      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems potentially brittle. I know it would require an owners review from the CC folks, but could we perhaps encode this logic as a function in `cc/cc.go` instead, and call it after doing a checked typecast?\n\nThe way it\u0027s done right now will break if typenames change.\n\n\nIf this really is the only way to do it for some reason, this at a minimum needs a comment explaining why and what you\u0027re trying to test for.",
