      "writtenOn": "2023-04-10T20:44:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed, string names of types should never be necessary.  If you wanted to check the type you could use a type assertion: `if _, isPrebuilt :\u003d module.(*Module).linker.(*cc.prebuiltLibraryLinker)`.  But even that is brittle, as it won\u0027t match a module that wraps a `prebuiltLibraryLinker`.  For that, use `c.IsPrebuilt()`.",
